{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳一段車 Cam 影片，昨晚（27 日）有一名 86 歲老翁拉着手拉車，在九龍灣觀塘道逆線穿越多條行車線，期間多輛車輛閃避，更有巴士急煞停下讓路，險象環生。警方其後接報趕至現場，尋獲該名自稱「蕩失路」的老翁，並已協助將他安全送回家中。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h46m31s136.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026oNpjWEE13j1785207810.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h46m31s136.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h46m34s802.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026W1qvUIO8jn1785207810.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h46m34s802.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片所示，地點位於九龍灣啟業邨對開一段觀塘道往旺角方向，該名老翁拉着手拉車逆線穿越多條行車路，現場車來車往，駛過的車輛紛紛閃避，期間有巴士更急煞停下讓伯伯先行。上載影片的網民在社交平台留言表示：「今日<strong> 20</strong>：<strong>36</strong>係九龍灣，呢個老人家可能係啲認知障礙症，好危險，最後都冇事。」</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong> </strong></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h46m37s148.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20267cB2pRKPOC1785207810.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-28-10h46m37s148.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據了解，有駕駛人士目擊事發經過後隨即報案。執法人員於昨晚 8 時 16 分接報，指一名老翁在觀塘道往旺角方向近啟業邨對開行車線徘徊。人員接報到場後，順利找到該名 86 歲老翁。老翁向人員表示自己當時準備乘搭巴士，但期間「蕩失路」。人員其後成功與老翁家人取得聯絡，並把老翁安全送回家中。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-28 上午10.47.13.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026w6iT5FBhYB1785207810.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-28 上午10.47.13.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T04:19:17.712713+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":404,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}